_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVicXaQ36vUBkOFExjcOobJH9L0y_qtV3p66QvDXdQcYQ&oe=6B1052E8"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1811705440046972", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_1811705443380305_4773766464636240009_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pJ0esLc2DRgQ7kNvwFBZ00d&_nc_oc=AdpFWZCoS7ra8AM1i8Dp9j-HgqT1NtMa17637JCzUTZ4nYEH1hLKWkInKoHipyKYqk4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUVli1STGiQ8baeTmnUyskqduDgxaocDVRk4SRgMSpFQw&oe=6B105F51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TVGlow - IPTV & More", "keywords": ["IPTV", "M3U", "TV", "EPG", "Player"], "long_description": "TVGlow plays your own IPTV source: an M3U playlist or Xtream login, or your own Plex, Jellyfin or Emby server. It does not include channels or TV subscriptions.\n\nWATCH IN THE ROOM\nA cinema-sized screen in a 3D room: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room. Or a panel you can resize.\n\nFREE, FOR AS LONG AS YOU LIKE\nLive TV, Guide, search, movies and shows with resume, recently watched, Home rows, sports schedules, favorites and a list of your own, with one source, in 20 languages. No email or card. Add your source and you're watching in a minute.\n\nWANT MORE? ONE PREMIUM PURCHASE\nAn optional one-time purchase through the Meta Horizon Store. It unlocks player features, not TV content: Multiview screens around you, Timeshift and Replay, downloads, channel organization, filters, more sources and lists, online subtitles, and end-to-end encrypted sync. It covers up to 6 active devices in total: headsets, phones, tablets, TVs and PCs. Try Premium free for 7 days with no card.\n\nTimeshift, Replay and downloads depend on your source. Use only content you are authorized to access or download.\n\nTVGlow is a media player only. It provides no channels, playlists or other content, and is not affiliated with any IPTV provider.\nPlex and Plex Media Server are trademarks of Plex, Inc.; Jellyfin and Emby are trademarks of their respective owners. TVGlow works with these media servers but is not affiliated with, endorsed by or certified by any of their owners.", "short_description": "Your own IPTV playlist or media server on a cinema-sized screen: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room, or a resizable panel. A clear TV guide, one click to play, and movies and shows that pick up where you left off. Free player: no in-app ads, no time limit, no sign-up.\n\nTVGlow plays your own M3U playlist, Xtream login or home media server; it does not include channels or TV subscriptions. One optional Premium purchase also covers your phone, tablet, TV and PC."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tvglow.app/privacy/meta-quest/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://tvglow.app/terms/", "publisher_name": "18228001 Canada Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://tvglow.app/support/", "website_url": "https://tvglow.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN", "fr", "hi", "es", "pt_BR", "bn", "ru", "id", "ur", "ja", "mr", "vi", "de", "te", "tr", "he", "ko", "it", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1376833518855887"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2396044211135909"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2396044211135909"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795374360, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2396044211135909"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1416048644934374", "version": "1.0.15"}, "id": "1071067292415367", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1322966744242565", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1416048644934374"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1071067292415367"}]}, "change_log": "\"TVGlow 1.0.15\\n- Easier Premium sign-in on the headset: Sign in now opens on the email step. We send one sign-in email; open it in any web browser, including the headset's, tap Approve, and the headset finishes by itself. A code for another device is still one button away.\\n- TVGlow works without signing in. Signing in is only for Premium.\\n- Media servers: big libraries now get their genre categories.\\n- Fixes and improvements.\"", "created_date": 1795563093, "id": "1416048644934374", "version": "1.0.15", "version_code": 1112, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1322966744242565", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1416048644934374"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1071067292415367"}]}, "change_log": "\"New in this update of TVGlow for Meta Quest:\\n\u2022 Your room: watch your screens floating in your own room with passthrough. Pick it from Scene in the Room.\\n\u2022 Curve the screen, turn on ambient glow, and tilt the room to watch lying back.\\n\u2022 Play side-by-side and top-and-bottom 3D movies in 3D.\\n\u2022 The Room menu and the app window open at a comfortable distance in front of you.\\n\u2022 The Guide opens faster, and the first channel and guide update after installing an update is quicker.\\n\u2022 With Premium: Timeshift (pause and rewind live TV) is steadier after a stream hiccup, and changes sync between your devices within seconds.\\nTVGlow is a media player only. It provides no channels, playlists, or other content. Add your own M3U playlist, Xtream login, or media server.\"", "created_date": 1795377167, "id": "1412054335333805", "version": "1.0.14", "version_code": 1110, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1322966744242565", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1416048644934374"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1071067292415367"}]}, "change_log": "\"First Meta Horizon Store release of TVGlow, the player for your own IPTV source (M3U playlist or Xtream login) and your own home media server.\\n\u2022 Live TV, Guide, Search, movies and shows with resume, your own lists and sports schedules.\\n\u2022 Watch in a 3D room: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room. With Premium, place Multiview screens around you.\\n\u2022 Premium is a one-time purchase that covers up to 6 active devices in total.\\nTVGlow is a media player only. It provides no channels, playlists or other content.\"", "created_date": 1793994641, "id": "1369468436259062", "version": "1.0.9", "version_code": 1054, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1322966744242565", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1416048644934374"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1071067292415367"}]}, "change_log": "First Meta Horizon Store release of TVGlow, the player for your own IPTV source (M3U playlist or Xtream login) and your own home media server.\n\u2022 Live TV, Guide, Search, movies and shows with resume, your own lists and sports schedules.\n\u2022 Watch in a 3D room: a living room, an outdoor theatre, a stadium, a lodge or a dark room. With Premium, place Multiview screens around you.\n\u2022 Premium is a one-time purchase that covers up to 6 active devices in total.\nTVGlow is a media player only. It provides no channels, playlists or other content.", "created_date": 1793939474, "id": "1367297079809531", "version": "1.0.9", "version_code": 1053, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1322966744242565", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1416048644934374"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1071067292415367"}]}, "change_log": "\"